        "text": "<thinking> The user requested a Python file named `database_client.py` that provides local configuration and client helper utilities for a Managed NoSQL Document Store. I will create this file using the `write` tool, ensuring that the code includes a concrete third-party managed service integration. I will use Amazon DynamoDB as the NoSQL Document Store, as it is a widely-used managed service. </thinking>\n",
